m he had formed.", "words": [[2, 54984], [6, 55123], [10, 55223], [15, 55463], [19, 55803], [27, 56343], [29, 56543], [36, 56863], [45, 57543], [48, 57723], [54, 58637], [58, 58763], [64, 59023], [67, 59183], [71, 59363], [75, 59543], [79, 59863], [84, 60063], [87, 60243], [91, 60403]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 61493, "end": 72755, "text": "And out of the ground made the LORD God to grow every tree that is pleasant to the sight, and good for food; the tree of life also in the midst of the garden, and the tree of knowledge of good and evil.", "words": [[0, 61493], [4, 61598], [8, 61778], [11, 61898], [15, 61978], [22, 62278], [27, 62558], [31, 62718], [36, 62978], [40, 63278], [43, 63498], [48, 63718], [54, 64058], [59, 64418], [64, 64638], [67, 64778], [76, 65118], [79, 65338], [83, 65438], [90, 65778], [94, 66218], [99, 66398], [103, 66598], [109, 67414], [113, 67494], [118, 67734], [121, 67894], [126, 68174], [131, 68694], [134, 68974], [138, 69054], [144, 69294], [147, 69494], [151, 69614], [159, 70374], [163, 70654], [167, 70774], [172, 71034], [175, 71154], [185, 71574], [188, 71834], [193, 72074], [197, 72214]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 73205, "end": 80890, "text": "And a river went out of Eden to water the garden; and from there it was parted, and became into four heads.", "words": [[0, 73205], [4, 73351], [6, 73451], [12, 73691], [17, 73931], [21, 74151], [24, 74291], [29, 74571], [32, 74831], [38, 75111], [42, 75331], [50, 77073], [54, 77216], [59, 77396], [65, 77776], [68, 78016], [72, 78196], [80, 78776], [84, 79256], [91, 79576], [96, 79856], [101, 80176]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 81340, "end": 87996, "text": "The name of the first is Pison: that is it which compasses the whole land of Havilah, where there is gold;", "words": [[0, 81340], [4, 81427], [9, 81687], [12, 81827], [16, 81947], [22, 82287], [25, 82802], [32, 83548], [37, 83848], [40, 84028], [43, 84128], [49, 84328], [59, 84968], [63, 85108], [69, 85348], [74, 85728], [77, 85888], [86, 86728], [92, 86988], [98, 87168], [101, 87348]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 88446, "end": 93223, "text": "And the gold of that land is good: there is bdellium and the onyx stone.", "words": [[0, 88446], [4, 88575], [8, 88675], [13, 88955], [16, 89155], [21, 89315], [26, 89635], [29, 89815], [35, 90637], [41, 90964], [44, 91394], [53, 91824], [57, 92044], [61, 92144], [66, 92624]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 93673, "end": 99762, "text": "And the name of the second river is Gihon: the same is it that compasses the whole land of Ethiopia.", "words": [[0, 93673], [4, 93793], [8, 93893], [13, 94153], [16, 94313], [20, 94433], [27, 94693], [33, 95053], [36, 95586], [43, 96418], [47, 96578], [52, 96958], [55, 97178], [58, 97318], [63, 97458], [73, 98118], [77, 98278], [83, 98478], [88, 98798], [91, 98978]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 100212, "end": 107906, "text": "And the name of the third river is Hiddekel: that is it which goes toward the east of Assyria. And the fourth river is Euphrates.", "words": [[0, 100212], [4, 100338], [8, 100438], [13, 100678], [16, 100878], [20, 100998], [26, 101278], [32, 101598], [35, 102094], [45, 102825], [50, 103012], [53, 103312], [56, 103352], [62, 103532], [67, 103832], [74, 104192], [78, 104432], [83, 104672], [86, 104892], [95, 105907], [99, 106055], [103, 106295], [110, 106535], [116, 106835], [119, 107115]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 108356, "end": 113317, "text": "And the LORD God took the man, and put him into the garden of Eden to dress it and to keep it.", "words": [[0, 108356], [4, 108462], [8, 108602], [13, 108862], [17, 109182], [22, 109502], [26, 109702], [31, 110022], [35, 110282], [39, 110462], [43, 110622], [48, 110822], [52, 110982], [59, 111302], [62, 111502], [67, 111822], [70, 112042], [76, 112322], [79, 112562], [83, 112742], [86, 112882], [91, 113082]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 113767, "end": 119753, "text": "And the LORD God commanded the man, saying, Of every tree of the garden you may freely eat:", "words": [[0, 113767], [4, 113895], 